<title>USA: Lufthansa sees Jan-May NY-JFK cargo growth.</title>
<headline>Lufthansa sees Jan-May NY-JFK cargo growth.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Lufthansa AG said it handled 48,253 tonnes of cargo between January-May 1997, up 6,993 on the same period in 1996.</p>
<p>The following table lists the total cargo tonnage, including mail, the carrier handled at JFK during the period in question compared to January-May 1996.</p>
<p>		    Jan-May 97	 Jan-May 96</p>
<p> January	  7,850 tonnes     6,831 tonnes</p>
<p> February	 8,868		7,548</p>
<p> March	   10,790		9,087</p>
<p> April	   10,269		8,953</p>
<p> May	     10,476		8,841</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Service Tel +44 171 542 7706 Fax +5017 - www.racs.com</p>
